WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.561 --> 00:00:02.322
- Oh hey, yo, that doesn't count.

00:00:02.322 --> 00:00:03.134
I got a text.

00:00:03.134 --> 00:00:06.060
"Yo, TJ said to call him ASAP."

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.337
- Why would he not just call you

00:00:07.337 --> 00:00:09.194
if it's an emergency?

00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:10.355
- I do something wrong?

00:00:10.355 --> 00:00:12.201
- You get all his toilet paper?

00:00:12.201 --> 00:00:14.428
(whoosh, squeak)

00:00:16.477 --> 00:00:17.696
- Did we pay rent?

00:00:17.696 --> 00:00:21.051
- Did you video the wrong Steve again?

00:00:21.051 --> 00:00:23.373
Maybe he like, won the lottery.

00:00:23.373 --> 00:00:24.359
- You think so?

00:00:24.359 --> 00:00:27.517
- [Voiceover] Seven, 16,
nine, five, three, and 30.

00:00:27.517 --> 00:00:29.596
- [Short man] What if he
got somebody pregnant?

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.070
- Oh shit.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.076
What if he did get somebody pregnant?

00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:37.118
Maybe just, like, car trouble.

00:00:37.118 --> 00:00:40.229
- Yeah exactly, what if it is car trouble?

00:00:40.229 --> 00:00:41.553
(explodes)

00:00:41.553 --> 00:00:43.677
- I mean, it's not like he's in jail.

00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:49.348
- He's arguing with the neighbors again.

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:50.601
- You got your stupid parties,

00:00:50.601 --> 00:00:52.145
where you're up all
night, I don't say shit.

00:00:52.145 --> 00:00:53.527
- Damn, did I leave the gas on?

00:00:53.527 --> 00:00:55.471
(explodes)

00:00:55.471 --> 00:00:58.399
- Maybe you need milk.

00:00:58.399 --> 00:01:01.062
- Maybe...

00:01:01.062 --> 00:01:04.161
- Bruh, didn't get kidnapped.

00:01:04.161 --> 00:01:06.457
Maybe he listened to my mixtape.

00:01:06.457 --> 00:01:08.268
(explodes)

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.612
When's the last time
you called him anyway?

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:11.704
- Yo, what's up?

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:12.308
You okay?

00:01:12.308 --> 00:01:13.144
- [Voiceover] Yeah, just need to know

00:01:13.144 --> 00:01:15.988
the Wi-fi password.

00:01:15.988 --> 00:01:16.870
- Seriously?

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:21.363
All right, it's uh, syrupsandwich490.

00:01:21.363 --> 00:01:23.290
- No, no, that's too long.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:24.863
Can you just text it to me?

